Relevant columns & why they matter  
• WORLD_PORT_INDEX."region_number": filter to the requested region ( 6585 )  
• WORLD_PORT_INDEX."country": keep only U.S. ports (value = ‘US’)  
• WORLD_PORT_INDEX."port_name": the human‑readable port identifier to report  
• WORLD_PORT_INDEX."port_geom": WKB geometry for spatial overlay / distance tests  
• STATES."state_name": label the state in which a port sits  
• STATES."state_geom": polygon geometry to test whether a port is inside a state boundary  
• HURRICANES."basin": restrict to the North Atlantic (‘NA’)  
• HURRICANES."usa_wind": wind speed ( ≥ 35 kts ≙ tropical‑storm force )  
• HURRICANES."usa_sshs": Saffir–Simpson category ( ≥ 0 ≙ minimal TS strength )  
• HURRICANES."name": named storm identifier (for DISTINCT list)  
• HURRICANES."season": four‑digit season / year (for DISTINCT list & aggregation)  
• HURRICANES."latitude", HURRICANES."longitude": build storm‑location geometries  
• HURRICANES."sid": unique storm id (for counting DISTINCT storms)

